  "description": "Replacement of existing single glazed timber sash windows  with slim line double glazed timber sash windows, with through glazing bar",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its inappropriate detailed design and materials and the failure to demonstrate that the windows are beyond reasonable repair, fails to &lt;span class=&quot;myDiv&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;conserve and enhance the significance of the listed building and fails to preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the conservation area. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;The proposal therefore fails to comply with policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) and LP3 (Designated Heritage Assets) of the Hackney Local Plan LP33 (2020) and policies D4 (Delivering good design) and HC1 (Heritage conservation and growth) of the London Plan (2021) and the advice in Hackney&#x27;s Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2025) and Hackney&#x27;s Retrofit SPD (2025) and the Kingsland Conservation Area Appraisal (2018).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
